{"5336360":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Crown to Callus","steam_appid":5336360,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A crown is heavy. A pickaxe is heavier.<\/h2>Crown to Callus is a story-driven incremental clicker about a king who must learn the value of the work he once took for granted. From an archery camp to mines, a foundry, and a factory, gather resources, upgrade your tools, and build your way home.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A new trade at every stage<\/h2>Time your shots, mine ore, smelt alloys, and expand your production chain. Spend your earnings on upgrades, recruit helpers, and turn modest gains into growing production.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From clicking to building<\/h2>Combine active clicking with your helpers’ output. Choose your next investment, unlock new stages, and assemble your ship piece by piece.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More to learn than a trade<\/h2>Once quick to command and slow to appreciate his soldiers, the king now carries their burden himself. As the numbers grow, so does his understanding of the people behind them. Every step brings him closer to home—and a different view of what it means to wear a crown.","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A crown is heavy. A pickaxe is heavier.<\/h2>Crown to Callus is a story-driven incremental clicker about a king who must learn the value of the work he once took for granted. From an archery camp to mines, a foundry, and a factory, gather resources, upgrade your tools, and build your way home.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A new trade at every stage<\/h2>Time your shots, mine ore, smelt alloys, and expand your production chain. Spend your earnings on upgrades, recruit helpers, and turn modest gains into growing production.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From clicking to building<\/h2>Combine active clicking with your helpers’ output. Choose your next investment, unlock new stages, and assemble your ship piece by piece.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More to learn than a trade<\/h2>Once quick to command and slow to appreciate his soldiers, the king now carries their burden himself. As the numbers grow, so does his understanding of the people behind them. Every step brings him closer to home—and a different view of what it means to wear a crown.","short_description":"A story-driven incremental clicker about a proud king learning the value of hard work. Shoot arrows, mine ore, smelt alloys, and build a production chain. Recruit helpers, upgrade your tools, and work your way home, one click at a time.","supported_languages":"English, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Turkish","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5336360\/2539056c6730f4a0fe8e32e5382efdc0bbc8a77d\/header.jpg?t=1793650650","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5336360\/3c54bea1de19e1d2067afdb1414099a655cf1637\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793650650","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5336360\/3c54bea1de19e1d2067afdb1414099a655cf1637\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793650650","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 \/ 11 (64-bit) <br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-6100 or equivalent <br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 \/ AMD Radeon R7 260X or equivalent (OpenGL 3.3) <br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Estimated requirements; subject to change before release. Keyboard and mouse required. <\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_